1. Install the tools once:


winget install Microsoft.DotNet.SDK.10
winget install Git.Git
Then open a new terminal so it picks them up.

2. Clone and run:

git clone https://github.com/CalabarBatman/RacingAudioSpotter.git
cd RacingAudioSpotter
dotnet test
dotnet run --project src/RacingAudioSpotter
